  "training_recipe": "Adopted factorized player-only joint GRU. Reuse exact clean/legacy plus 25% whole-window ball-gap and player-slot-dropout records, equal provider/match mass, train-only normalization, 5 Hz, 10 s core plus 5 s context on both sides, hidden size 24, 8 epochs, AdamW .001/.0001, batch 64, gradient clip 1, direct and H/A-swapped records. Loss objective is the only change.",
  "short_spell_weight": "At native frame resolution, weight only complete H/A runs. A run touching a match/time-block edge or adjacent X/unknown label is censored and stays neutral. D and unknown targets stay neutral. Per-spell factor is clip(sqrt(5 seconds / duration), 0.5, 2.0); normalize factors to mean 1 over eligible complete-spell sampled H/A rows within each record. Apply the factor only to conditional H/A classification loss; preserve the marginal D/live gate loss and each record/source training mass. H/A swap augmentation shares the same duration factors.",
  "transition_auxiliary": "No added head. On adjacent sampled known targets in one model period, require every native target between their source indices to be known and in one uninterrupted full-resolution period. Use a marginal P(D) change surrogate whose P(D) comes from the player-only dead path, plus a conditional H/A switch surrogate on adjacent live targets. Each component is cost-sensitive: one half of the stable-group mean plus one half of the changed-group mean; absent groups contribute zero. The D/live component and conditional H/A component each receive a fixed half of the auxiliary loss; absent components contribute zero. Per-source/match weights preserve the existing record mass. Fixed auxiliary coefficient lambda=.1. This balanced marginal surrogate is cost-sensitive and is not a calibrated/native transition likelihood. Combined adds this term to the H/A-weighted NLL.",
  "training_labels": "Use existing external training labels only. Full-resolution labels are mapped to H/A/D ids and X/unknown=-1; spell runs break at model-period and timestamp discontinuities. No evaluation labels enter either objective.",
  "primary": "Equal-provider official mean possession-spell F1, with exact ties broken by macro F1; report every IoU .3-.7. Also report fixed auxiliary .70 spell + .30 macro, not used for ranking.",
  "guardrails": "Per seed: feed_like stress spell F1 at least matched control -0.01; each provider clean D-F1 and macro-F1 at least matched control -0.02. A clean spell gain of +0.01 is the predeclared positive screen.",
  "budget": "18 new fits (3 objectives x 3 full-provider folds x 2 seeds); reuse six sealed adopted slot-dropout controls (zero new control fits). Score all four arms on five development matches: one clean view and two fixed feed_like stress replicates. Seal every model before any scoring.",
